LINES = [{'id': 'rule', 'text': 'In this town, if you make someone sad, a rain cloud follows you around until you make it right.'}, {'id': 'soaked', 'text': "Our mailman Gus ate my sister Lily's cupcake. He got rained on for three whole blocks."}, {'id': 'popped', 'text': 'Then he bought her two new cupcakes. She smiled, and his cloud popped like a bubble.'}, {'id': 'fake', 'text': "Sorry only counts if you mean it. Dad forgot Mom's birthday, said a fake sorry, and his cloud thundered."}, {'id': 'forecast', 'text': 'Our weather report is just a list of who was mean. Today: eighty percent chance of Dad.'}, {'id': 'kevin', 'text': "Grandpa's had the same tiny cloud for fifty years. He calls it Kevin. He won't say why."}, {'id': 'vance', 'text': "Then there's Mr Vance. He owns the only umbrella shop, and nobody's ever seen him smile."}, {'id': 'cancel', 'text': 'Business was slow, because people here are nice. So Vance cancelled the fair and the puppy parade.'}, {'id': 'storm', 'text': 'Three hundred sad people made one cloud so big, it rained on the whole town.'}, {'id': 'prices', 'text': 'And guess who sells umbrellas? Five dollars. Then fifty. Then five hundred.'}, {'id': 'flood', 'text': "The streets flooded. Gus's mailbag filled with water. Lily's new cupcake floated right out of her hands."}, {'id': 'photo', 'text': 'That night, Grandpa showed me an old photo. Two boys laughing, holding one kite.'}, {'id': 'secret', 'text': 'The other boy was Vance. Grandpa broke that kite, laughed, and never said sorry. Fifty years ago.'}, {'id': 'brave', 'text': 'So I did something mean. I took his umbrella and said, no more hiding. My first cloud appeared instantly.'}, {'id': 'sorry', 'text': "We walked through the storm. Grandpa held out a new kite and said, I'm sorry, Vance."}, {'id': 'smile', 'text': 'Vance smiled for the first time in fifty years. And Kevin popped like a bubble.'}, {'id': 'twist', 'text': "The biggest storm in town history didn't start with Vance. It started with one tiny cloud named Kevin."}, {'id': 'sunny', 'text': 'Vance said sorry to all three hundred people, gave away every umbrella, and the sun came out.'}, {'id': 'record', 'text': 'And my cloud? I hugged Grandpa, and it popped. Kevin lasted fifty years. Mine lasted six minutes. Family record.'}]
